eights bar when someone doubted he could fly from New Jersey to New York in 15 minutes.", "s": 8.286, "e": 19.351}, {"text": "At three A.M., he took a single-engine plane and touched down cleanly on St. Nicholas Avenue right outside the bar.", "s": 19.471, "e": 28.18}, {"text": "Two years later, after another drinker didn't believe him, he did it a second time.", "s": 28.3, "e": 33.516}]}